  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Condom Procurement for the Social Marketing Sector - Tanzania (United Republic) (01-Apr-2014-31-Dec-2016)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tanzania has a high prevalence of HIV and AIDS, and the rate of HIV infection is rising rapidly.  The program supported by this grant focuses on providing male and female condoms to the sexually active population in Tanzania through social marketing.  The program targets the sexually active population, people living with HIV and AIDS, sex workers and youth enrolled and not enrolled in school.</narrative>
  </description>
